# DailyDose+ — Cursor Project Rules

**Initiative by MealOBox** | Vital Clarity Design System | mealobox.in

## Identity

DailyDose+ is a health-tech product by MealOBox. Brand voice: **calm, competent, trustworthy** — wellness concierge, not clinical, not generic SaaS.

## Stack (non-negotiable)

- Pure HTML5 + Tailwind CSS v3 (CDN, no build step)
- Vanilla JavaScript ES6+ only — no React, Vue, or frameworks
- Google Fonts: Lexend (300–800); Material Symbols Outlined (CDN)
- No npm, bundler, or node_modules

## File naming

`index.html`, `features.html`, `how-it-works.html`, `mealobox-sync.html`, `for-providers.html`, `data-security.html`, `terms.html`

Shared **navbar** and **footer**: extract from `_components.html` (reference only, not deployed).

## Design System — Vital Clarity (NON-NEGOTIABLE)

Never use arbitrary hex in markup or utilities. Use tokens from the `tailwind.config` block in every page `<head>`. Source: `vital_clarity/DESIGN.md`.

| Intent | Token / value |
|--------|----------------|
| Medication / urgent UI | `tertiary`, `tertiary-container` |
| Hydration / positive progress | `water` (#00a651) — token or safelist only |
| CTAs, nav active, trust | `primary` |
| Card backgrounds | `surface-container-lowest` |
| Dark feature cards | `inverse-surface` |

**Typography:** Lexend only — `text-display`, `text-headline-lg`, `text-headline-md`, `text-body-lg`, `text-body-md`, `text-label-lg`, `text-label-sm` (never raw px).

**Spacing:** `container-padding`, `stack-gap`, `inline-gap`, `section-margin` — 8px grid; no ad-hoc spacing.

**Radius:** buttons `rounded-xl` / pill CTAs `rounded-full`; cards `rounded-lg`; feature highlights `rounded-xl`.

**Shadows:** `soft-shadow` only (`0 4px 20px rgba(0,91,191,0.08)`). Never `shadow-lg` or hard dark shadows.

## Components

- **Navbar:** fixed, `w-full`, `top-0`, `z-50`, `bg-surface`, `shadow-sm`
- **Footer:** 4-column desktop, stacked mobile; `hello@mealobox.in`, `mealobox.in`, copyright line below
- **Cards:** min `p-6`; medicine cards `border-l-4 border-tertiary-container`
- **Water UI:** SVG ring with `stroke-dasharray` / `stroke-dashoffset`; token strokes (`stroke-water`, `stroke-surface-container-low`)
- **Primary button:** `bg-primary text-white min-h-[56px] rounded-xl active:scale-[0.98]`
- **Outlined:** `border-2 border-current bg-transparent active:scale-[0.98]`
- Min touch target 44×44px

## JavaScript

- `<script>` at bottom of `<body>` only — no external `.js`
- `const`/`let`; no `var`; no inline `onclick`
- `addEventListener`; `IntersectionObserver` for scroll behaviors (ToS nav, scroll-to-top)
- JS toggles classes; CSS handles transitions

## Accessibility

- `lang="en"` on `<html>`
- One `h1`, then `h2`, then `h3`
- `aria-label` on icon-only controls and interactive SVGs
- `:focus-visible` → `outline-2 outline-primary`
- State never by color alone — icon or text too

## Copy & footer

- No Lorem ipsum
- Copyright: © 2025 DailyDose+ — An initiative by MealOBox Foodtech Pvt. Ltd.

## Quality gates (before done)

- No console errors in Chrome; mobile OK at 375px
- Relative inter-page hrefs correct
- Full Vital Clarity `tailwind.config` in `<head>`
- Lexend + Material Symbols load correctly
- Footer + copyright present on every page

Regenerate pages after shared edits: `python3 scripts/build-pages.py`
